        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Crush Point</strong> – a fast-paced arcade puzzle game where every crush creates chaos. Balls multiply, colors collide, grenades explode, and blades slice through the arena. Your goal? Survive, strategize, and complete unique challenges before everything falls apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977490/extras/f43e905bb9d6eb9a0719a22477757c0f.poster.avif?t=1760442931\" width=604 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977490/extras/f43e905bb9d6eb9a0719a22477757c0f.webm?t=1760442931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977490/extras/f43e905bb9d6eb9a0719a22477757c0f.mp4?t=1760442931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Crushing Action</strong> – Every ball you crush spawns more, turning each level into a chain reaction of chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive Obstacles</strong> – Grenades and blades aren’t just hazards, they’re game-changers. Crush grenades before they explode and avoid blades that can’t be destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color Ball Mode</strong> – Balls of the same color burst on collision. Master timing and placement to clear the arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Level Objectives</strong> – Produce grenades, crush blades, clear all color balls, survive with a single yellow ball, or outlast deadly traps. Every stage brings a fresh twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Challenges</strong> – Limited moves, survival timers, and clever ball placement make every decision matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Play Mode</strong> – No rules, no objectives. Just you, balls, grenades, and blades in pure endless fun for as long as you want.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>𖣘Blades and Grenades💣</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly obstacles that slice or explode through everything in their path, turning each level into a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977490/extras/3395249fb2a8e11b6ba3f7daa9a9b92b.poster.avif?t=1760442931\" width=608 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977490/extras/3395249fb2a8e11b6ba3f7daa9a9b92b.webm?t=1760442931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977490/extras/3395249fb2a8e11b6ba3f7daa9a9b92b.mp4?t=1760442931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎯Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on unique challenges, crush your way through each level, and prove your skills to unlock the next stage. From dodging blades to bursting color balls and handling explosive grenades, every challenge is different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977490/extras/6d6f24c52bee571993fa0c19297a7f2c.poster.avif?t=1760442931\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977490/extras/6d6f24c52bee571993fa0c19297a7f2c.webm?t=1760442931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977490/extras/6d6f24c52bee571993fa0c19297a7f2c.mp4?t=1760442931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌟 <strong>Why Play Crush Point?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, hard to master. Whether you’re chasing high scores, relaxing with casual levels, or battling through chaotic obstacle courses, <strong>Crush Point</strong> delivers explosive arcade fun with puzzle-like strategy.<br></p>",
